We have a limited operating history in a new and evolving market, which makes it difficult to evaluate our future prospects.
The software industry is developing rapidly. The regulatory framework for this market is also evolving and may remain
uncertain for the foreseeable future. Potential users may have difficulty distinguishing our services from those of our competitors.
